  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/NE6fdKPXFG\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/992415/description_b5c4d7ea-cf25-47f7-88bd-1ee93be239ad.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"501\" height=\"141\"></a></p>\n<div><br><a href=\"https://url-shortener.curseforge.com/cL6Fu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><br>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n</a><span style=\"color:#fff\">我的社群連結：</span><br><span style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ft.me%252fpodpivasiki228\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Telegram</a></span> <span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><a style=\"color:#e67e23\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fboosty.to%252fdanilapodpivas\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Boosty</a></span> <span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><a style=\"color:#ba372a\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@Danila_PodPivas\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">YouTube</a> <span style=\"color:#843fa1\"><a style=\"color:#843fa1\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.tiktok.com%252f%2540danila_podpivas0%253f_t%253dZM-8xdg6aAHGG0%2526_r%253d1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">TikTok</a></span></span></span></div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#ba372a\">此模組預設可破壞方塊。</span><br><span style=\"color:#ba372a\">&nbsp;您可於設定檔中關閉此功能。</span></h1>\n<hr>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\">需要 GECKOLIB</h1>\n<hr>\n<p><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\">此恐怖模組新增了一種單一實體——鼴鼠。它雖失明但聽覺極佳。請專注潛行，並使用雪球來分散其注意力。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\">鼴鼠於夜間在地表活動，白天則在洞穴出沒。請務必牢記這一點。</span></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\">涉及劇透：<br>模組主要機制</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/992415/description_5c359037-8bb4-46be-a771-aa6bc34575ea.gif\" alt=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\">白天時鼴鼠會在洞穴中活躍。若您不夠安靜，它便會察覺到您並以驚人速度衝刺而來。它會一擊必殺您，因此請務必小心。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/992415/description_df5889d4-c273-4d5b-8733-25b48ea3ab13.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"426\" height=\"240\"><br>生物會試圖逃離路線以保全性命。運氣不佳者將遭殲滅。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/992415/description_4b83646e-a8cc-4cfa-a728-8f39f3a8ddb6.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"426\" height=\"240\"><br><span style=\"color:#fff\">它的生成伴隨巨大聲響與爆炸（可於設定檔中關閉）</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/992415/description_b73651cb-7fef-40fa-936d-665a7b65d993.gif\" alt=\"\"><br><span style=\"color:#fff\">它能輕易撕裂樹木以追捕您（可於設定檔中關閉）</span><br><br></p>\n</div>",
